  "purpose": "<p>The Economic Affairs Finance Bill Sub-Committee considers aspects of the Finance Bill from the point of view of technical issues of tax administration, clarification and simplification.</p>\r\n<p>This Committee is a Sub-Committee of the <a href=\"https://committees.parliament.uk/committee/175/economic-affairs-committee/\">Economic Affairs Committee</a></p>\r\n<p>Follow the&nbsp;Economic Affairs Committee on <a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/showcase/economic-affairs-committee\">LinkedIn</a> and X (formerly Twitter) using <a href=\"https://twitter.com/LordsEconCom\">@LordsEconCom</a></p>",
